"task\" untouched.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]8[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]6[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202608/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]background_tasks_to_procs.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202608/background_tasks_to_procs.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-lh[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-lh/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Rename the Rust background-task core to procs[/bold #D7AFFF]                 [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]core[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]core: rename `crates/sase_core/src/tasks/` to `procs/` in ../sase-core, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]rename the wire structs and the `task_id` field to `Proc*`/`proc_id`, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]bump the wire schema to 2 while still deserializing legacy `task_id` [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]records, and expose canonical [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`read_procs_snapshot`/`append_proc`/`update_proc`/`prune_procs` PyO3 [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]bindings alongside the existing legacy binding names.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Move the Python package to sase.procs and migrate on-disk [/bold #D7AFFF]    [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]state and config[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]store[dim] · [dim][/dim]after core[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]store: `git mv src/sase/tasks src/sase/procs`, rename `BackgroundTask` [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]to `Proc` and `task_id` to `proc_id` throughout, move the store to [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`~/.sase/procs/procs.jsonl` with a marker-guarded one-shot migration, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]rename the `tasks.history_limit` config key to `procs.history_limit` [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]with the legacy key still honored, and update [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`tools/validate_sase_core_rs` plus the monitor cross-references.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Rename the sase task CLI command tree to sase proc[/bold #D7AFFF]            [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]cli[dim] · [dim][/dim]after store[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]cli: rename `sase task` to `sase proc` with `task` registered as a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]legacy alias and facade shim modules, rename the parser/handler/render [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]modules and the `--json` envelope key, and update the CLI help text, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]tests, and `docs/cli.md`.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Rename the TUI tracked-task runtime to procs[/bold #D7AFFF]                  [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]tui-runtime[dim] · [dim][/dim]after store[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]tui-runtime: rename `task_queue.py`, `task_mirror.py`, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`task_subprocess.py`, `task_actions.py`, `widgets/task_indicator.py`, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and the `_*_tasks.py` action mixins to their proc spellings, rename [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`TaskQueue`/`TaskMirror`/`TaskReporter`/ [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`TrackedTask*`/`_submit_tracked_task` and every call site, without [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]changing displayed text.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Rename the ACE Tasks pane and Admin Center tab identifier to [/bold #D7AFFF] [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]procs[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]tui-pane[dim] · [dim][/dim]after store[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]tui-pane: rename the `tasks_pane*` and `tasks_store_rows` modules and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`TasksPane` to their proc spellings, move the Admin Center tab [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]identifier from `tasks` to `procs` with persisted-state migration, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]rename the `#tasks-*` DOM ids and their `styles.tcss` selectors, without[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]changing displayed text.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  6 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Flip user-visible Task text to Proc and refresh snapshots[/bold #D7AFFF]     [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]labels[dim] · [dim][/dim]after cli, tui-runtime, tui-pane[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]labels: change every displayed string that names this feature — Admin [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Center tab label, pane title and hints, command palette entries, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]quit-confirm copy, status messages, CLI help — from Task to Proc, then [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]regenerate the affected text and PNG snapshot goldens.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  7 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Rewrite documentation, memory, skills, and the glossary[/bold #D7AFFF]       [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]docs[dim] · [dim][/dim]after labels[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]docs: rewrite the background-task sections of docs/ace.md, cli.md, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]configuration.md, integrations.md, beads.md, sdd.md, notifications.md, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]plugins.md, monitors.md, and INSTALL.md, update [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`sase/memory/tui_perf.md` and the `sase_monitor` skill, add a `Proc` [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]glossary entry to `sase/sase.yml`, and run `sase memory init`.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  8 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Verify the migration and land the epic[/bold #D7AFFF]                        [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]land[dim] · [dim][/dim]after docs[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]land: run the exhaustive verification lane over the combined tree, sweep[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]for residual background-task spellings, confirm no emitt